  _senarioDescription: You start to sprint down the stairs, halfway mid sprint the
    contents of your stomach began to spill itself all over the place. It would seem
    you've eaten too much earlier today and could not contain due to your nerves.
    As you stand hunched over heaving, the creature walks up to you towering over
    you and slowly unhinging its jaw to reveal its mouth that looks like a portal
    to another dimension, framed by razor-sharp teeth. In one quick motion, this
    creature swallows you whole. \nLess protein - Ending
